#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Buddy OS Universal AI Engine v4 - Do Anything as AI

This engine is designed to handle ANY task — from code creation to web operations,
file management, analysis, and beyond. It integrates legacy memory, advanced memory,
working memory, skills registry, and provides a complete autonomous execution loop.

Features:
- Task classification into categories (conversation, action, general)
- Code generation and execution with self-healing
- RUN command execution
- Skill awareness and utilization
- Persistent working memory
- Personality and mood tracking
- Graceful shutdown with state persistence
- REAL TIME AWARENESS - knows current date/time
- AUTO-INSTALL missing Python packages
"""

